<title>UK: London gold ends lower after Australian sale news.</title>
<headline>London gold ends lower after Australian sale news.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $331.20/$331.80 vs $332.10/$332.60 previously. Unsettled by news of Australia selling 167 tonnes of gold. Short covering rally brief, inconclusive.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished a cent lower at $4.64/$4.66.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended barely changed at $423.00/$428.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Just $0.50 easier at $189.50/$194.50.</p>
</text>
